    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27749" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διωγ-μός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the chase,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.4.21
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pursuit,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.13
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				34.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				31.191
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>persecution, harassing,</i> in pl., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				148
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1046
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				412
			</span></i>; also in later Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.483a
			</span></i>: sg., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				13.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				8.1
			</span></i>.</div>
